{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.fuyuko.badge",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "商店街排起了长队",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.fuyuko.badge",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.fuyuko.badge",
    "idolId": "fuyuko",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "哇～……已经排了这么多人吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "人真多啊……你打算排这条队？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "当然！就是为了这个才带你来的嘛。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "工作也好好地提前赶完了呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（确实……刚才的工作，她比平时更有干劲。）",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你到底为了什么这么……嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "看这个画面。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "呃……『「ミラクル♡ミラージュ」徽章发售通知』？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "对！这个超可爱的店铺限定随机徽章，今天发售！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（原来是在说这个。工作那么拼，是为了这个啊……）",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她说这话时的表情，比拍摄时生动多了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……不是，别一直看着我啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她别过脸去，但排队的脚步没停。）",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……あんた也帮我看看，哪个种类最可爱。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
  "createdAt": "2026-11-02T13:00:00.000Z",
